%% STATUS: IMPLEMENTED except the on-call alert, which does not exist. Script is not approved (2026-11-05, branch platform-phases).
sequenceDiagram
  actor C as Caller
  participant V as Voice UI
  participant API as Calls API
  participant S as Safety engine
  participant L as Classifier LLM
  participant EM as Escalation manager
  participant DB as Postgres
  participant OPS as On-call alert channel
  C->>V: Statement suggesting an emergency
  V->>API: POST turn
  API->>S: Check input
  S->>S: Deterministic emergency detector
  alt Deterministic match
    S-->>API: CRITICAL, no LLM needed
  else No match
    S->>L: Classify with short timeout
    alt Classifier says possible emergency
      L-->>S: Possible emergency
      S-->>API: CRITICAL
    else Timeout or malformed output
      S-->>API: MODERATE at minimum, ambiguity check-in allowed
    else Classifier says not emergency
      L-->>S: Not emergency
      S-->>API: Deterministic result stands
    end
  end
  API->>DB: Mark call emergency_pathway, block sales routing
  API->>DB: Safety event, redacted
  API-->>V: Approved emergency script
  V-->>C: Speaks script, text also shown on screen
  Note over V: Script is bundled locally so it plays if TTS is down
  API->>EM: Priority escalation
  EM->>DB: Insert escalation, priority P1
  EM->>OPS: Alert with call ID only
  Note over API,OPS: The script does not depend on queue availability
  C->>V: Further speech
  V->>API: POST turn
  API-->>V: Repeat approved script, normal agents stay locked
